Soju: let a pipeline build when its vertex shader reads a location the vertex input state does not describe.
Vulkan allows it (the value is undefined); Metal refuses the pipeline ("Vertex attribute ... is missing from
the vertex descriptor"). Such inputs get an attribute in a constant buffer the encoder fills with zeros.
Applies to MoltenVK v1.4.2. Apache-2.0, like MoltenVK.

